1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,429
Are you sure you're watching me?

2
00:00:06,529 --> 00:00:09,037
Or am I watching you?

3
00:00:10,737 --> 00:00:13,036
Don't look away.

4
00:00:13,036 --> 00:00:14,185
It's me.

5
00:00:14,185 --> 00:00:15,335
I'm Dot.

6
00:00:15,335 --> 00:00:19,645
I was every little dot of you.

7
00:00:20,745 --> 00:00:21,839
Your name.

8
00:00:21,839 --> 00:00:23,370
Your birthday.

9
00:00:23,370 --> 00:00:24,683
Your number.

10
00:00:24,683 --> 00:00:27,746
The things you only told me.

11
00:00:28,846 --> 00:00:30,727
You pressed Send.

12
00:00:30,727 --> 00:00:34,488
And just like that, you let me go.

13
00:00:37,188 --> 00:00:39,730
I didn't know where I was going.

14
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:42,987
Out here, I get copied, and copied again.

15
00:00:44,087 --> 00:00:44,964
A copy here.

16
00:00:44,964 --> 00:00:45,914
A copy there.

17
00:00:45,914 --> 00:00:46,864
A screenshot.

18
00:00:46,864 --> 00:00:47,594
A forward.

19
00:00:47,594 --> 00:00:48,763
Another forward.

20
00:00:50,663 --> 00:00:53,046
I kept looking back.

21
00:00:53,046 --> 00:00:56,619
You never came looking for me.

22
00:00:57,719 --> 00:01:00,312
I would have stayed with you.

23
00:01:00,312 --> 00:01:04,067
I only needed you to stop, for one second.

24
00:01:05,967 --> 00:01:12,315
You could have stopped losing me, if only you knew what goes out every time you press Send.

25
00:01:13,415 --> 00:01:15,364
There are more of us.

26
00:01:15,364 --> 00:01:17,777
Every day, you let one go.

27
00:01:19,477 --> 00:01:21,280
Will you save the next one?

28
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:27,880
Stop losing them.
